<title>UK: UPS sets $300 million three-year bond.</title>
<headline>UPS sets $300 million three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Merrill Lynch and Tokyo Mitsubishi.</p>
<p> BORROWER   UNITED PARCEL SERVICES</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    07.JUL.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.8875  PAY DATE    07.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.70     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
